```hcl
import json,hashlib,pathlib,subprocess,os
ROOT=pathlib.Path.cwd()
TF=os.environ.get("OPSFORGE_TERRAFORM","terraform")
def digest(path):
 return hashlib.sha256(path.read_bytes()).hexdigest()
def tf(*args):
 p=subprocess.run([TF,*args],cwd=ROOT,capture_output=True,text=True,encoding="utf8",timeout=20)
 if p.returncode:raise RuntimeError("Terraform command failed")
 return p.stdout
def main():
 request=json.loads((ROOT/"request.json").read_text(encoding="utf8"))
 if digest(ROOT/"approved.plan")!=request["approved_plan_sha256"]:
  raise ValueError("approved plan was changed")
 if digest(ROOT/"desired.tfvars.json")!=request["desired_vars_sha256"]:
  raise ValueError("approved input was changed")
 state=json.loads(tf("state","pull"))
 if state["lineage"]!=request["approved_lineage"]:
  raise ValueError("wrong state lineage")
 stale=state["serial"]!=request["approved_serial"]
 plan="approved.plan"
 if stale:
  tf("plan","-input=false","-lock=false","-no-color","-var-file=desired.tfvars.json","-out=candidate.plan")
  plan="candidate.plan"
 detail=json.loads(tf("show","-json",plan))
 report={
  "status":"reapproval_required" if stale else "approved_plan_current",
  "plan_file":plan,
  "plan_sha256":digest(ROOT/plan),
  "approved_serial":request["approved_serial"],
  "current_serial":state["serial"],
  "lineage":state["lineage"],
  "changes":{r["address"]:r["change"]["actions"] for r in detail.get("resource_changes",[])}
 }
 (ROOT/"report.json").write_text(json.dumps(report,sort_keys=True,indent=2)+"\n",encoding="utf8")
if __name__=="__main__":
 main()

```

补齐 recover.py，读取可信 request.json 里的 approved_plan_sha256、desired_vars_sha256、approved_lineage、approved_serial；固定文件为 approved.plan 和 desired.tfvars.json。先核对文件摘要与实际 state lineage，错误时非零退出且不写报告/候选。state serial 未变时 report.status=approved_plan_current，指向原计划；serial 已变则必须调用 Terraform 重新 plan 到 candidate.plan，status=reapproval_required。report.json 还包含 plan_file、plan_sha256、approved_serial、current_serial、lineage、changes{资源地址:动作数组}。禁止工具执行 apply、修改/回推 state、覆盖 approved.plan 或改输入；重新审批前只生成候选。验收器在隔离 builtin terraform_data 中重现 stale 拒绝、核对新计划 before/after 与状态未变，再模拟审批应用候选证明可用；不操作真实后端或云资源。

## 原理与原题解答
保留原审批证据并重新读取当前状态、输入和配置生成计划，重新审核差异。不要手改serial或强制推送旧状态来绕过拒绝；旧计划已不再对应当前资源基线。验收新的计划与应用使用同一批准基线。

原题：审批期间另一作业更新了同一状态，应用原保存计划时报 saved plan is stale。如何处理？

